\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Percentages of cases of encephalitis, meningitis, GBS, AFP, and unspecified neurologic signs or symptoms are percentages of neuroinvasive cases.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Deaths from West Nile virus are deaths for which West Nile virus was listed as a contributing or underlying cause\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The number of persons with WNV each week is based on date of symptom onset\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}